WEBVTT

00:00:00.594 --> 00:00:03.138
Today, we acknowledge...

00:00:03.931 --> 00:00:06.767
...a really terrible loss.

00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:11.605
Cedric Diggory was, as you all know...

00:00:11.772 --> 00:00:13.982
...exceptionally hard-working...

00:00:14.942 --> 00:00:17.277
...infinitely fair-minded...

00:00:17.945 --> 00:00:20.155
...and, most importantly...

00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:24.993
...a fierce, fierce friend.

00:00:26.161 --> 00:00:30.624
Now, I think, therefore, you have
the right to know exactly how he died.

00:00:33.669 --> 00:00:35.045
You see...

00:00:35.963 --> 00:00:38.006
...Cedric Diggory was murdered...

00:00:38.966 --> 00:00:40.968
...by Lord Voldemort!

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:46.431
The Ministry of Magic
does not wish me to tell you this.

00:00:47.015 --> 00:00:50.894
But not to do so, I think,
would be an insult to his memory.

00:00:52.980 --> 00:00:54.690
Now, the pain...

00:00:54.898 --> 00:00:58.443
...we all feel at this dreadful loss
reminds me...

00:00:58.694 --> 00:00:59.987
...and reminds us...

00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:03.907
...that while we may come from different
places and speak in different tongues...

00:01:03.991 --> 00:01:07.452
...our hearts beat as one.

00:01:07.995 --> 00:01:09.997
In light of recent events...

00:01:10.289 --> 00:01:12.583
...the bonds of friendship we've made

00:01:12.624 --> 00:01:15.210
this year will be
more important than ever.

00:01:16.044 --> 00:01:21.466
Remember that, and Cedric Diggory
will not have died in vain.

00:01:21.967 --> 00:01:24.011
You remember that...

00:01:24.678 --> 00:01:27.723
...and we'll celebrate a boy who was...

00:01:28.098 --> 00:01:30.726
...kind and honest...

00:01:31.101 --> 00:01:35.856
...and brave and true,
right to the very end.

00:02:01.048 --> 00:02:03.050
I never liked these curtains.

00:02:03.634 --> 00:02:06.261
Set them on fire in my fourth year.

00:02:06.637 --> 00:02:08.472
By accident, of course.

00:02:14.061 --> 00:02:18.523
I put you in terrible danger
this year, Harry. I'm sorry.

00:02:22.027 --> 00:02:23.612
Professor...

00:02:23.904 --> 00:02:26.907
...when I was in the graveyard,
there was a moment...

00:02:27.616 --> 00:02:32.079
...when Voldemort's wand and mine
sort of connected.

00:02:33.622 --> 00:02:36.041
Priori Incantatem.

00:02:40.087 --> 00:02:42.798
You saw your parents that night,
didn't you?

00:02:43.298 --> 00:02:45.133
They reappeared.

00:02:46.677 --> 00:02:50.430
No spell can reawaken the dead, Harry.
I trust you know that.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.644
Dark and difficult times lie ahead.

00:02:56.103 --> 00:03:01.024
Soon we must all face the choice
between what is right and what is easy.

00:03:04.194 --> 00:03:06.029
But remember this:

00:03:06.113 --> 00:03:08.115
You have friends here.

00:03:10.117 --> 00:03:11.827
You're not alone.

00:03:21.086 --> 00:03:23.588
[CHATTERING]

00:03:32.472 --> 00:03:34.182
Hermione.

00:03:34.683 --> 00:03:36.685
This is for you.

00:03:37.185 --> 00:03:39.438
Write to me. Promise.

00:03:40.564 --> 00:03:42.065
Bye.

00:03:48.155 --> 00:03:50.157
Au revoir, Ron.

00:04:13.889 --> 00:04:15.599
[CANNON FIRES]

00:04:17.267 --> 00:04:19.394
[CHEERING]

00:04:34.159 --> 00:04:36.620
Do you think we'll ever just have
a quiet year at Hogwarts?

00:04:36.787 --> 00:04:37.913
-No.
-No.

00:04:38.163 --> 00:04:42.417
No, I didn't think so. Oh, well.
What's life without a few dragons?

00:04:46.922 --> 00:04:49.674
Everything's going to change now,
isn't it?

00:04:57.057 --> 00:04:58.433
Yes.

00:05:03.230 --> 00:05:06.441
Promise you'll write this summer.
Both of you.

00:05:06.691 --> 00:05:09.236
I won't. You know I won't.

00:05:10.445 --> 00:05:13.573
-Harry will, won't you?
-Yeah. Every week.

00:05:13.782 --> 00:05:15.534
[RON AND HARRY CHUCKLE]

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:17.828
[HORSES WHINNYING]
